ng  purge he once again saves a group of  people but he allows carmelo's vengeful  ways to influence him and he stays  behind to do more fighting rather than  help the survivors get to safety in the  years that would follow it's implied  that he does a lot of good with his  organization by helping the injured and  the homeless but he gets a mixed  reputation  based on how he goes about things also i  mean we can't just look past the fact  that he automatically knew how to  hotwire a car i mean he's obviously up  to some shady stuff but overall he did  have good intentions and he played a  vital part in stopping  the nffa and the purge if he and carmelo  hadn't saved leo barnes in 2023 and leo  never would have been there to protect  senator rohn in 2040.  and if he hadn't sacrificed himself in  2040 who knows if she would have  survived let me know in the comments if  there are any other purge characters  you'd like to see covered here on horror  history and if you love the purge i've  got plenty more purge videos on the way  so check out that playlist on the left  and remember to subscribe to cz's world  for new horrors every week ring the  death bell for notifications and i'll  see you in the next one assuming we both  survive  and just like the purge i recommend you  stay home but if you have to go out  wear a mask
 

